  "content": "シュタイナーの公式（凸体の平行体）を使う。\nV(K) = V0 + S r + M r^2 + (4/3) pi r^3、 S(K) = S + 2 M r + 4 pi r^2。\nV0 = sqrt(2)/12、S = sqrt(3)、M = Σ 辺の長さ × (pi − 二面角)/2 = 6 × (pi − acos(1/3))/2 = 3(pi − acos(1/3))。\n\nr = 0.6 のとき:\nV = sqrt(2)/12 + 0.6 sqrt(3) + 1.08 (pi − acos(1/3)) + 0.288 pi ≈ 4.12534\nS = sqrt(3) + 3.6 (pi − acos(1/3)) + 1.44 pi ≈ 13.1342\n\n答え(a): sqrt(2)/12 + 0.6*sqrt(3) + 1.08*(pi - acos(1/3)) + 0.288*pi\n答え(b): sqrt(3) + 3.6*(pi - acos(1/3)) + 1.44*pi\n",
